# refuses Bot1's own Ornithopter and Bot2's Plains (the lands are neither) and takes Bot2's Mox Jet, an artifact that is no
# creature. The mana value is three whether or not the {2} could have been paid (CR 202.3). On turn 4 Bot2's Disenchant destroys
# the Tether and the Mox comes back to the battlefield, a new object, under its owner's control.

